      "courseBoundary": "Original SN2025 cover/effect dates and physical16/printed4 distinguish course lists. Physical59/printed47 continues LK12;60/printed48 Wahlbereich1 Farbstoffe belongs to LK12, with chromophore/donor-acceptor, indicator structure, dyeing experiments (vat as example), history/application and problem positioning. GK12 has no Farbstoffe option in its list: the already authored GK reflection/research targets are a declared own extension, not the LK elective silently relabelled GK.",
